BBMTLib - Bold Bitcoin MPC TSS Library
Copyright 2025–2026 Bold Bitcoin Wallet

This product includes software from the following open-source projects:

- libtss (0xCarbon) — DKLs23 MPC backend
  Source: https://github.com/0xCarbon/libtss
  License: Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE in upstream repository)
  Use: Distributed key generation and threshold signing via libtss-go and libtss-ffi.
  Integration: Prebuilt native libraries under mobile-deps/libtss; Go bindings in BBMTLib/dkls.
  Protocol: DKLs23 (https://github.com/0xCarbon/DKLs23)

- Mobile TSS Lib (Vultisig) — GG18 MPC stack
  Source: https://github.com/vultisig/mobile-tss-lib
  License: Apache-2.0
  Modifications: Adapted networking logic; rectified TSS for BTC scope.

This product also uses the following third-party libraries as dependencies:

- Binance TSS Lib (MIT) — https://github.com/bnb-chain/tss-lib
- go-nostr (MIT) — https://github.com/nbd-wtf/go-nostr — Nostr relay transport for MPC
- btcsuite / btcd (MIT)
- decred / dcrd (ISC)
- ecies-go (MIT)
- gorilla/mux (BSD-3-Clause)
- go-cache (MIT)
- ipfs/go-log (MIT)
